  "validation": "Paired mask, rank, window and refreshed construction endpoint builds pass. All 37 target names, 32 public and five private type/axiom reports, 35,447 global simp entries and corrected direct/production endpoints match. Current direct providers match prior or fresh source/object receipts.",
