    "The original archive says construction checks were pending; the separately included supplement completes them. Historical Band/Rows and post-build mask workspace-source samples differ from current source, with the correct candidate/fresh objects matched separately.",
    "The first endpoint probe pinned only one of two imports; a fresh pair pins both. An initial construction probe used a wrong namespace and was replaced; the reverse-cast simp experiment failed and lacked a standalone status receipt.",
    "Historical project, Foundation and package objects remain cached; prior pin summaries do not establish a clean transitive closure. Compiled objects and the replay environment are excluded."
